      "value": "Yeah im having issues getting my tongue to match the animation in unity. Scale is supposed to increase to unhide the tongue but in game it simply doesnt work. Write defaults is OFF. The same animation also rotates my ears, and that works perfectly fine, it seems like its just scale that wont work.\n I was having the issue where my tongue kept sticking to one side but i fixed that by making sure NO scale values for XYZ in the animation were less than 1. even .85 would break it. Im not sure why that was the fix, probablya related bug, since even values above 1 dont display properly in game.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
