  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, my Avatar has a tongue which can be moved out, while doing that the phys bone is turned on, moved and scaled as well as the parent bone of it. (Screenshot of animations below) Everything seems to work fine, but for some reason the bone does not want to stay in its normal position / the pull doesn’t pull it back to where it should be. This does only seem to occur when the pull is really small.\nThis issue is really weird since it doesn’t work with small pull values but with higher ones it does work. I also tested manually uploading it with a pulled-out tongue (so without any animations happening) and then it seems to work fine. \nBelow you can see a few pictures showing my setup. (Tongue2 is where the phys bone is on)",
